!_datasets/
!_datasets/09_dashboards/**
!_datasets/11_share_ready/**
!**/09_dashboards/**/*.html
!**/11_share_ready/**/*.html
!**/09_dashboards/**/warehouse.db
!**/11_share_ready/**/warehouse.db
!_datasets/**/*.zip
